### Obtener eventos y comentarios de una asignación — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getEventsAndComments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345
}

### Obtener eventos y comentarios con límite personalizado — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getEventsAndComments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345,
  "limit": 20
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getEventsAndComments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345
}

### RouteAssignmentId inválido (0) → 400 (debe ser mayor que 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getEventsAndComments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 0
}

### RouteAssignmentId inexistente → 200 con listas vacías
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getEventsAndComments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 999999999
}
